"Yingxia" = "映匣";
"Yingxia / TVBOX" = "映匣 / TVBOX";
"About Yingxia" = "關於映匣";
"Sign in on the provider's official page. Yingxia stores the login on this Mac and supplies it to the plugins you run." = "在官方頁面登入。映匣會將登入資訊儲存在這台 Mac 上，並提供給你執行的外掛。";
"Sign in by scanning a code with the drive's phone app. Yingxia keeps the sign-in on this device and supplies it to the plugins you run." = "用網盤的手機 App 掃碼登入。映匣會將登入資訊儲存在這台裝置上，並提供給你執行的外掛。";
"This entry opens the source's own settings or sign-in screen (such as a QR code), which Yingxia can't show. Sign in under Settings → Cloud Drive Accounts instead." = "此項目會開啟來源自帶的設定或登入畫面（例如 QR 碼），映匣無法顯示。請改在「設定 → 網盤帳號」中登入。";
"The source says: %@" = "來源提示：%@";
"Yingxia is up to date" = "映匣已是最新版本";
"Yingxia %@ is the latest version." = "映匣 %@ 已是最新版本。";
"Yingxia %@ is available" = "映匣 %@ 已推出";
"What's New in Yingxia" = "映匣新功能";
"Yingxia %@ is ready with new features." = "映匣 %@ 已就緒，帶來了新功能。";
"This update can't be installed from within Yingxia yet. Download it instead." = "暫時無法在映匣內安裝此更新，請手動下載。";
"Yingxia couldn't relaunch to finish the update. Quit Yingxia and open it again." = "映匣未能重新開啟以完成更新。請結束映匣後再開啟。";
"Yingxia downloads updates in the background and installs them the next time it quits." = "映匣會在背景下載更新，並在下次結束時安裝。";
"Yingxia %@" = "映匣 %@";
"Yingxia %@ is ready in TestFlight. Open TestFlight and tap Update to get these features." = "映匣 %@ 已在 TestFlight 上架。打開 TestFlight 並點一下「更新」即可取得這些新功能。";
"Yingxia %@ is ready in TestFlight. Open TestFlight on this Apple TV and update Yingxia to get these features." = "映匣 %@ 已在 TestFlight 上架。在這台 Apple TV 上打開 TestFlight 並更新映匣，即可取得這些新功能。";
"Add This Subscription?" = "加入這個訂閱？";
"A page can only ask: Yingxia adds this subscription after you agree, never on its own." = "網頁只能提出請求：確認後映匣才會加入這個訂閱，不會自行加入。";
"Douyin signs in only on its own web page, which Apple TV can't show. Sign in with Yingxia on your iPhone instead:" = "抖音只能在它自己的網頁上登入，而 Apple TV 無法顯示該頁面。請改用 iPhone 上的映匣登入：";
"On your iPhone, open Yingxia, go to Settings > Douyin, and sign in." = "在 iPhone 上打開映匣，進入「設定 > 抖音」並登入。";
"Scan this code with the iPhone's Camera and open it in Yingxia." = "用 iPhone 的相機掃描此條碼，並在映匣中打開。";
"The source took too long to respond, so Yingxia stopped waiting. Try another line, or try again later." = "這個來源太久沒有回應，映匣已停止等待。請換一條線路，或稍後再試。";
"Sign in to Quark and UC on their official page, and to Baidu and Aliyun by scanning a code with their phone app. Yingxia stores the login on this Mac and supplies it to the plugins you run." = "夸克和 UC 在官方頁面登入，百度網盤和阿里雲盤用手機 App 掃碼登入。映匣會將登入資訊儲存在這台 Mac 上，並提供給你執行的外掛。";
"Type a song's name, or its name and the artist. Yingxia finds the recording and plays it from the best channel available, lossless first." = "輸入歌名，或歌名加歌手。映匣會找到這首歌的錄音，並從目前最好的渠道播放，優先無損。";
"Liked Songs" = "我喜歡的歌曲";
"No Liked Songs" = "還沒有喜歡的歌曲";
"Like a song from its menu, and it waits here, ready to play as one list." = "在歌曲選單中選擇「喜歡」，歌曲就會留在這裡，隨時可以當一張歌單播放。";
"Help Make Yingxia Better" = "幫助映匣變得更好";
"What would make Yingxia better for you?" = "怎樣能讓映匣更好用？";
"Your feedback becomes a public issue on Yingxia's GitHub page, with the app and system versions, the device model, the language and the included details. Please don't include accounts or passwords." = "你的意見會作為公開問題發佈在映匣的 GitHub 頁面上，並附帶 App 與系統版本、裝置型號、語言和附帶資訊。請勿填寫帳號或密碼。";
"Allow Yingxia to add photos in Settings, then try again." = "請在「設定」中允許映匣加入照片，然後再試一次。";
"Sign in on the drive's own page, or scan a code with the drive's app on another phone. Yingxia keeps the sign-in on this device and supplies it to the plugins you run." = "在網盤官方頁面登入，或用另一支手機上的網盤 App 掃碼登入。映匣會將登入資訊儲存在這台裝置上，並提供給你執行的外掛。";
"Sign in to Quark and UC on their official page. Yingxia stores the login on this Mac." = "夸克和 UC 在官方頁面登入。映匣會將登入資訊儲存在這台 Mac 上。";
"Sign in on the drive's own page, or scan a code with the drive's app on another phone. Yingxia keeps the sign-in on this device." = "在網盤官方頁面登入，或用另一支手機上的網盤 App 掃碼登入。映匣會將登入資訊儲存在這台裝置上。";
"Sign in by scanning a code with the drive's phone app. Yingxia keeps the sign-in on this device." = "用網盤的手機 App 掃碼登入。映匣會將登入資訊儲存在這台裝置上。";
"News and notices from Yingxia appear here." = "映匣的公告和通知會顯示在這裡。";
"%@ didn't answer. Make sure Yingxia is open on it and both devices are on the same network." = "%@ 沒有回應。請確認它已打開映匣，而且兩部裝置在同一個網路中。";
"Turn on Local Network for Yingxia in the Settings app, then try again." = "請在「設定」App 中為映匣開啟「區域網路」，然後再試一次。";
"Yingxia on %@ doesn't have the source %@. Add the same subscription there, then try again." = "%@ 上的映匣沒有隨選來源「%@」。請在那裡加入相同的訂閱，然後再試一次。";
"This video plays from inside Yingxia on this device, so %@ can't open it." = "這部影片是在這部裝置的映匣內部播放的，%@ 無法開啟。";
"With Yingxia open here, your other devices on the same network can send it what they play: tap Play On in their player." = "在這裡打開映匣後，同一個網路中你的其他裝置可以把正在播放的內容傳到這裡：在它們的播放器中點一下「在其他裝置上播放」。";
"Yingxia searches quick, reliable sources first." = "映匣會優先搜尋快速、穩定的來源。";
"Shows cast, artwork and episode details from TMDB on video pages. Sends the video's title, its details from the source and the source's name to Yingxia's lookup service, never your accounts or subscription addresses." = "在影片頁面顯示來自 TMDB 的演員、海報和劇集資訊。會把影片的標題、來源提供的簡介和劇集名稱，以及來源的名稱傳送給映匣的查找服務，絕不傳送你的帳號或訂閱地址。";
"This source plays none of the catalogs Yingxia searches (QQ Music, NetEase Cloud Music, Kuwo, Migu)." = "這個音源不支援映匣搜尋的任何曲庫（QQ 音樂、網易雲音樂、酷我、咪咕）。";
"Scripts made for LX Music's custom sources. They are asked for a song's audio after the channels above, for QQ Music, NetEase Cloud Music, Kuwo and Migu songs. Yingxia includes none: add only sources you trust." = "為洛雪音樂「自訂源」編寫的腳本。上方的通道之後才會向它們取得歌曲音訊，適用於 QQ 音樂、網易雲音樂、酷我和咪咕的歌曲。映匣不內建任何音源，請只加入你信任的音源。";
"This extension asks an LX Music source for something Yingxia doesn't support." = "這個擴充向洛雪音源請求的內容映匣尚不支援。";
"Scripts in the Listenify music extension format. Their charts and playlists show on the Music page and their songs in Music search; songs play from what the extension gives, or through your LX Music sources when it asks for one. Yingxia includes none: add only extensions you trust." = "Listenify 格式的音樂擴充腳本。它們的榜單和歌單顯示在音樂頁，歌曲出現在音樂搜尋中；歌曲從擴充給出的位址播放，擴充需要時也會透過你的洛雪音源播放。映匣不內建任何擴充：只加入你信任的擴充。";
