/* 出站代理 / Loon */
"Add Loon" = "新增 Loon";
"Both ranges are in place. They decide where a request goes — except for a site Loon's own rules already classify: those follow the rules, because Loon checks them before the port. Sources whose sites are not in your rules (most of them) are fully controlled here." = "两段已就位。它们决定请求去向——但 Loon 自己规则已分类的站点除外：那些会跟随规则，因为 Loon 先看域名再看端口。站点不在你规则里的源（大多数）完全由此控制。";
"Both ranges went the same way — Loon's own rules decided" = "两段走了同一条路——是 Loon 自己的规则在决定";
"Check It Works" = "检查是否生效";
"Copy Loon Rule" = "复制 Loon 规则";
"Could not tell — neither range reached the test address" = "无法判断——两段都没能到达测试地址";
"Dialled for everything else, so Loon leaves it alone." = "其余一切从这里拨出，Loon 不会改动。";
"Dialled for sources you route through a proxy." = "你指定走代理的源从这里拨出。";
"Direct %@" = "直连 %@";
"Found" = "已找到";
"Found %@" = "已找到 %@";
"From Loon" = "从 Loon";
"Loon Configuration" = "Loon 配置";
"Loon has no SRC-PORT rule yet, so it decides each site by its own rules — Chinese sources go direct even though you added a proxy. Copy the rule from this page and paste it at the very top of Loon's [Rule] section." = "Loon 里还没有 SRC-PORT 规则，所以它按自己的规则逐站决定——国内源即便你加了代理也仍走直连。把这一页的规则复制到 Loon 的 [Rule] 最顶上。";
"Loon is not sharing its proxy on the local network. Turn on Allow Wi-Fi Access in Loon, then add it again." = "Loon 没有在局域网共享代理。请在 Loon 里打开「允许 Wi-Fi 访问」，然后重新添加。";
"Loon routes on the port range this app dials from. Turn the App Switch on in Loon's rules if a source should go through the selected line even when Loon would send it direct." = "Loon 按本 App 拨出的端口段分流。若某源应走当前线路而 Loon 会判它直连，就在 Loon 规则里启用本 App 的开关。";
"Loon shares its proxy on the local network while Allow Wi-Fi Access is on. Point this at its configuration page and the proxy ports are filled in for you." = "打开「允许 Wi-Fi 访问」时，Loon 会在局域网共享代理。填入它的配置页地址，代理端口会自动填好。";
"Loon still has the older wide SRC-PORT range (up to 41799). It covers the direct ports too, so sources set to direct would go through the node. Replace it with the two lines this page copies." = "Loon 里仍是旧的宽 SRC-PORT 段（到 41799）。它把直连端口也包进去了，于是设为直连的源会走节点。请替换成本页复制的两行。";
"No proxies yet" = "还没有代理";
"Only the proxy range is in Loon's rules. Add the second line for the direct range, otherwise those sources still go by Loon's own rules." = "Loon 规则里只有代理段。请补上直连段那一行，否则那些源仍按 Loon 自己的规则走。";
"Open Loon, turn on Allow Wi-Fi Access, and paste the address shown there. Loon's own address is used for the proxy, not this URL's port." = "打开 Loon，开启「允许 Wi-Fi 访问」，粘贴那里显示的地址。代理用的是 Loon 自己的地址，不是这个 URL 的端口。";
