"A reading is one ranged request for the first 256 KB of the line — the same thing the player does before it commits. The result is kept and reused until the source is measured again." = "一次測量只對線路前 256 KB 發出一次範圍請求，和播放器開始播放前做的事一樣。結果會保留並重複使用，直到該源再次測量。";
"Details for %@" = "%@ 的詳細資料";
"Drag a group's title onto another to change the order they are listed in; the menu on a title does the same two moves. Pinned and built-in groups keep the top." = "將分組標題拖曳到另一個標題上即可調整排列順序；標題上的選單也能做同樣的兩種移動。置頂與內建分組一律排在最前面。";
"Drag to set your own order — it is saved and survives a refresh. The route menu pins one source to Direct or Proxy; Auto follows what the last requests managed to reach." = "拖曳即可自訂順序，設定會儲存，重新整理後仍保留。線路選單可將單一源固定為 Direct 或 Proxy；Auto 會跟隨最近請求實際連上的線路。";
"Each source is asked for its newest video, then its first playable line is read through for a few hundred kilobytes: that gives the speed and the resolution shown below. A sweep costs one request per source, so run it when the network is the one you care about. Opening a video in a source counts as a measurement too, and every reading is kept until the source is measured again." = "會先向每個源查詢最新影片，再讀取第一條可播放線路的前幾百 KB，藉此得出下方顯示的速度與解析度。整批掃描每個源需一次請求，請在想確認網路狀況時執行。在源中開啟影片也算一次測量，所有測量結果都會保留到該源再次測量為止。";
