"Positive values show subtitles later. Applies to the video playing now." = "數值為正時字幕會延後顯示。套用於目前播放的影片。";
"Timing" = "時間軸";
"It is a RAR or 7z archive; only ZIP archives and SRT, WebVTT and ASS files can be shown." = "這是 RAR 或 7z 壓縮檔；只能顯示 ZIP 壓縮檔與 SRT、WebVTT、ASS 檔案。";
"That source has no episode to play." = "該源沒有可播放的集數。";
"That source is no longer in your subscriptions." = "該源已不在你的訂閱中。";
"%lld sources screened · about %lld measured · up to %.0f MB" = "%lld 個源已篩選 · 約 %lld 個已測 · 最大 %.0f MB";
"Confirm the sign-in in the %@ app: open it here, or scan the code with another phone." = "請在 %@ App 中確認登入：在此開啟，或用另一支手機掃描條碼。";
"This plugin setting only works in Android TVBox." = "此外掛設定僅在 Android TVBox 中有效。";
"%@ is ready — move sources into it below." = "%@ 已就緒——在下方把源移進來。";
"%@ · %d samples" = "%@ · %d 個樣本";
"%lld of %lld ticked" = "已勾選 %lld／%lld";
"%lld sources in scope" = "範圍內 %lld 個源";
"A group of your own sits above the subscriptions. Sources filed into it stay playable through their own feed." = "自訂分組排在訂閱之上。歸檔進去的源仍透過各自的訂閱正常播放。";
"A sweep asks each source for its newest video and reads a few hundred kilobytes of its first playable line; that is where the speed and the resolution come from. One request per source, so run it on the network you care about. Filing keeps what the sweep found: answered sources into one group, silent ones into another, unmeasured ones left alone." = "測速會向每個源索取最新影片，並讀取其第一條可播放線路的數百 KB 資料；速度與解析度即由此得出。每個源只發一次請求，請在你關心的網路環境下執行。歸檔會保留測速結果：有回應的源歸入一組，無回應的歸入另一組，未測速的則維持原樣。";
"Back to Their Subscription" = "回到所屬訂閱";
"Clear Ticks" = "清除勾選";
"File by Reachability" = "依可達性歸檔";
"Filed %lld answered and %lld silent sources; unmeasured ones were left where they were." = "已歸檔：有回應 %lld 個、無回應 %lld 個；未測速的維持原樣。";
"Group name" = "分組名稱";
"Measure and file" = "測速並歸檔";
"Move" = "Move";
"Move to…" = "移至…";
"Moved %lld sources into %@." = "已將 %lld 個源移至 %@。";
"New Group" = "新增分組";
"Probe This Group" = "測速此分組";
"Probe the Ticked Sources" = "測速已勾選的源";
"Reachable Group" = "可連線分組";
"Sent %lld sources back to their own subscription." = "已將 %lld 個源送回所屬訂閱。";
"The order is now the measured one; the Sources page follows it." = "排序已改為實測結果；源頁面會依此排序。";
"The route menu pins one source to Direct or Proxy; Auto follows what the last requests managed to reach. Ordering by measured speed bakes the sweep into your own order, which the Sources page then follows." = "路由選單可把單一源固定為直連或代理；自動則依最近請求實際連上的方式。依實測速度排序會把測速結果寫進你的自訂順序，源頁面隨後依此排序。";
"Tick %@" = "勾選 %@";
"Tick All in Scope" = "勾選範圍內全部";
"Tick sources to move just those; with nothing ticked the move applies to everything in the scope above. A move only changes which group lists a source — it still plays through its own subscription, and it survives a refresh." = "勾選源即可只移動這些；未勾選時，移動會套用到上方範圍內的全部。移動只改變源列在哪個分組——它仍透過所屬訂閱播放，重新整理後依然保留。";
"Unreachable Group" = "無法連線分組";
"Your Groups" = "你的分組";
"Double-Tap to Skip" = "雙擊快轉倒轉";
"Double-tap the left or right of the video to skip 10 seconds. Turn this off and a double tap plays or pauses instead." = "雙擊影片左側或右側可快轉或倒轉 10 秒。關閉後，雙擊將改為播放或暫停。";
